flowchart LR
 B[Buyer / Mandate Owner] --> UI[Riventa Web App]
 S[Supplier] --> UI
 I[Inspector] --> UI
 R[Independent Resolver] --> UI
 UI -->|buyer-signed mandate and funding| C[NEAR Trade Operations Contract]
 AG[Authorized Riventa Agent] -->|agent-signed permitted actions| C
 UI --> API[Backend API]
 API --> DB[(PostgreSQL projections / jobs)]
 API --> FS[(Encrypted Private Files)]
 API --> AI[Local Ollama]
 API --> POLICY[Deterministic Policy Engine]
 POLICY --> AG
 API -->|read / reconcile| C
 C --> FT[SDD NEP-141 Test Token]
 C -->|events and views| API
